# Dependencies
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Environment files
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# IDE and editor files
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Git and version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Documentation
**/*.md
**/README*
**/CHANGELOG*
**/LICENSE*

# Test and coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/coverage
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/test
**/tests
**/__tests__

# Cache directories
**/.cache
**/.parcel-cache
**/.nuxt
**/.next
**/.serverless

# OS generated files
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db

# Temporary files
**/tmp
**/temp
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp

# Build artifacts
**/target
**/out
**/*.tgz
**/*.tar.gz

# Docker files (prevent recursion)
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*

# Scripts and executables that may have permission issues
**/*.sh
# Allow specific required scripts for nginx JWT authentication
!docker/populate-jwks.sh
!docker/nginx-entrypoint.sh
**/*.bat
**/*.cmd
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.so
**/*.dylib

# Package manager files that may cause issues
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/.npmrc